        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA DSX AI Factory Platform introduces two open source projects, NVIDIA Kubernetes Engine (NVKE) and NVIDIA Kubernetes Recipes (NVKR), for building and operating managed Kubernetes services on GPU infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/manage-kubernetes-clusters-for-gpu-infrastructure-with-nvidia-kubernetes-engine/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:20.690Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVKR builds reproducible node images, container images, and packages from version-pinned sources, while NVKE uses those artifacts to provision and manage Kubernetes clusters through a REST API and controllers running on a management cluster.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/manage-kubernetes-clusters-for-gpu-infrastructure-with-nvidia-kubernetes-engine/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:20.690Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Both projects are in public preview under the Apache 2.0 license, with APIs and behavior subject to change, and are not yet recommended for production workloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/manage-kubernetes-clusters-for-gpu-infrastructure-with-nvidia-kubernetes-engine/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:20.690Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA is announcing two open source projects for building and operating managed Kubernetes services on GPU infrastructure—NVIDIA Kubernetes Engine (NVKE) and NVIDIA Kubernetes Recipes (NVKR).",
