        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVKE provides the software to run a managed Kubernetes service, installed on the factory’s infrastructure, with APIs to provision and manage clusters.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/manage-kubernetes-clusters-for-gpu-infrastructure-with-nvidia-kubernetes-engine/",
